'''Royal Jelly Hell (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[Queen's Condemnation]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Little Leaguer Cat]], Golfer Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

