'''Battle:''' Immediately send Courier to stall Queen B for a bit and force the Wall Doge to go behind Cyberhorn, then lure all the way to your base. Once Cyberhorn gets near your base, spawn Psychocat to Slow Cyberhorn and then start spamming Chill, Can Can, Fishman, and Courier alongside deploying Awakened Bahamut. Your Psychocat stack will Slow Cyberhorn, while your DPS stack will shred it. Once it dies, use your Cat Cannon to interrupt Queen B's attack and prevent her from Slowing your Bahamut. By this point, the Dark Otter should also be near your base. Bombercat will Freeze it while Queen B's attacks should hit your base instead of your units. Once it goes down, simple spam will either kill Queen B or leave it on low health by the time Cyberhorn #2 spawns. Take care of it with more spam and you should be able to kill it and go on to beat the stage.

